---
/**
 * One test as a catalogue row: its figure, name (opens the fact sheet), lab and sample, price and
 * «Agregar». Used by the groups and by the symptom views of Catalogo; the clicks are handled
 * page-wide by PorSintoma's script.
 */
import { muestras, productoDe, type Examen } from '../../data/examenes';
import { iconoExamen } from '../../data/iconos-examenes';
import { usd } from '../../lib/precio';

interface Props {
  e: Examen;
  color: string;
  grupo?: string;
  texto?: string;
  oculta?: boolean;
  /** Group name shown while searching. */
  nombreGrupo?: string;
}
const { e, color, grupo, texto, oculta = false, nombreGrupo } = Astro.props;
---

<li
  class="fila"
  data-fila
  data-grupo={grupo}
  data-texto={texto}
  hidden={oculta}
  style={`--tono:var(--color-${color})`}
>
  <span class="f-ico" aria-hidden="true">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24"><path d={iconoExamen(e.id)}></path></svg>
  </span>
  <button type="button" class="f-nombre" data-ficha={e.id}>
    <span class="f-t">{e.nombre}</span>
    <span class="f-meta">
      {[e.laboratorio, e.muestras.map((m) => muestras[m]).join(' · ')].filter(Boolean).join(' · ')}
    </span>
  </button>
  {nombreGrupo && <span class="f-grupo">{nombreGrupo}</span>}
  <span class="f-precio">{usd(e.precio)}</span>
  <button
    type="button"
    class="f-add"
    aria-pressed="false"
    data-add={productoDe(e)}
    aria-label={`Agregar ${e.nombre}`}
  >
    <span class="no">Agregar</span>
    <span class="si">✓</span>
  </button>
</li>

<style>
  .fila {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: auto 1fr auto auto auto;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 16px;
    padding: 12px 14px 12px 12px;
    border-radius: 18px;
    background: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.85);
    border: 1px solid rgb(48 47 42 / 0.07);
    transition:
      transform 0.25s var(--ease-out-soft),
      box-shadow 0.25s;
  }
  .fila[hidden] {
    display: none;
  }
  .fila:hover {
    transform: translateX(4px);
    box-shadow: 0 14px 30px -24px rgb(48 47 42 / 0.5);
  }
  .fila:global(.elegido) {
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-sage) 40%, white);
  }
  .f-ico {
    width: 46px;
    height: 46px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 30% 25%, rgb(255 255 255 / 0.9), transparent 60%),
      color-mix(in srgb, var(--tono) 35%, white);
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px color-mix(in srgb, var(--tono) 60%, transparent);
    color: var(--color-charcoal);
    transition: transform 0.35s var(--ease-out-soft);
  }
  .fila:hover .f-ico {
    transform: rotate(-8deg) scale(1.06);
  }
  .f-ico svg {
    fill: none;
    stroke: currentColor;
    stroke-width: 1.4;
    stroke-linecap: round;
    stroke-linejoin: round;
  }
  .f-nombre {
    all: unset;
    cursor: pointer;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2px;
    min-width: 0;
  }
  .f-t {
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 15.5px;
    color: var(--color-charcoal);
  }
  .f-nombre:hover .f-t,
  .f-nombre:focus-visible .f-t {
    color: var(--color-clay-deep);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }
  .f-meta {
    font-size: 12.5px;
    color: rgb(48 47 42 / 0.55);
  }
  .f-grupo {
    display: none;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: rgb(48 47 42 / 0.6);
  }
  :global([data-buscando]) .f-grupo {
    display: inline;
  }
  .f-precio {
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 16px;
    color: var(--color-charcoal);
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
  .f-add {
    font: inherit;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 800;
    min-width: 96px;
    padding: 10px 16px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-charcoal);
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--color-charcoal);
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: background 0.2s;
  }
  .f-add:hover {
    background: rgb(48 47 42 / 0.06);
  }
  .f-add .si,
  .f-add[aria-pressed='true'] .no {
    display: none;
  }
  .f-add[aria-pressed='true'] {
    background: var(--color-charcoal);
    color: var(--color-bone);
  }
  .f-add[aria-pressed='true'] .si {
    display: inline;
  }
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .fila {
      grid-template-columns: auto 1fr auto;
      gap: 10px 12px;
    }
    .f-grupo {
      display: none !important;
    }
    .f-precio {
      grid-column: 2;
    }
    .f-add {
      grid-column: 3;
      grid-row: 1 / span 2;
    }
  }
</style>
